{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to config/devices.json and edit. Credentials are NOT stored here:",
    "each device names an environment variable holding its SNMP community",
    "string, so this file stays safe to commit.",
    "",
    "  export AURA_SNMP_COMMUNITY='your-read-only-community'",
    "  export AURA_COLLECTOR=snmp",
    "",
    "device_type must be one of the five types the model was trained on:",
    "core-router, edge-switch, access-point, firewall, load-balancer.",
    "",
    "interfaces lists the ifIndex values to poll. Find them with:",
    "  snmpwalk -v2c -c <community> <host> 1.3.6.1.2.1.2.2.1.2"
  ],
